{"type":"npc","name":"Fractrix","folder":"OXYyRtFH3xfRbLNb","system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":199,"temp":0,"max":199,"details":""},"ac":{"value":33,"details":"all-around vision"},"allSaves":{"value":"+1 status to all saves vs. magic"},"speed":{"value":null,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":35}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"vitality","exceptions":[]},{"type":"void","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"spirit","value":10,"exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[{"type":"piercing","value":10,"exceptions":[],"doubleVs":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":[],"details":"Envisioning"},"level":{"value":12},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>The fractrix is an aeon representing the emergence of perfect order from a large and chaotic system. They represent the duality between the potential of infinite processes and their bounded or finite manifestations. Fractrixes repair recursive spatial anomalies and are therefore most often encountered by adventurers exploring structures like endless staircases or bottomless pits. Though they generally mean no harm to mortals who don't willingly create spatial anomalies, their infinite geometry can induce fits of confusion in observers, sparking conflict.</p><hr /><p>Aeons are caretakers of order and balance, who watch over reality and guard it from the excesses that would throw it astray. Those who seek to cause discord and chaos will find themselves at odds with aeons' goals.</p><h2>Boon and Bane</h2><p>Fractixes are most often encountered in the lairs of spellcasters who have bent space itself in order to confound intruders. If left alone to do its work, a fractrix might undo an enchantment that once prevented entrance through mundane means, granting adventurers access to an extradimensional space that was previously barred to them. It's equally likely, however, that the same fractrix could inadvertently trap those adventurers inside the extradimensional space once its task was complete.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 250/560/1,030 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, piercing), armor (light, medium), shield, perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Arcana, Athletics, Deception, Intimidation, Lore [Mathematics], Nature, Occultism, Performance, Religion, Stealth)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> body, bane, charisma, constitution, elongating, energy resistant (vitality, void), intelligence, light, mind, mind shield, mirrored, sensory (darkvision, scent, true seeing), space, space shield, spells (Divine: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.wzctak6BxOW8xvFV]{Enlarge}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.K2WpC3FFoHrqX9Q5]{Hypnotize}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.ksLCg62cLOojw3gN]{Planar Tether}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.PjhUmyKnq6K5uDby]{Shrink}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.69L70wKfGDY66Mk9]{Teleport}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.VlNcjmYyu95vOUe8]{Translocate}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.uqlxMQQeSGWEVjki]{Truesight}), strength, sturdy, wild, winged, wisdom</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Aoife Ester","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":6},"dex":{"mod":3},"con":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":6},"wis":{"mod":6},"cha":{"mod":4}},"perception":{"details":"spatial reckoning","mod":25,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"type":"truesight","acuity":"precise","range":60}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":18,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":21,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":24,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics +22":{"base":null},"arcana +25":{"base":null},"athletics +25":{"base":null},"deception +20":{"base":null},"intimidation +20":{"base":null},"nature +22":{"base":null},"occultism +22":{"base":null},"performance +22":{"base":null},"religion +25":{"base":null},"stealth +25":{"base":null},"acrobatics":{"base":22},"arcana":{"base":25},"athletics":{"base":25},"deception":{"base":20},"intimidation":{"base":20},"nature":{"base":22},"occultism":{"base":22},"performance":{"base":22},"religion":{"base":25},"stealth":{"base":25}},"traits":{"value":["aeon","monitor"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"med"}}},"_id":"4jNJTr3YiCUEpoUD","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/fractrix.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Fractrix","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":1,"height":1,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/fractrix.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/fractrix.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"name":"Mathematics Lore","type":"lore","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"1